# P2 through all eight waves (saw, square, pulse, double sine, saw-pulse, resonance I, II, III) under a held note,
# P1 high, then P1 down to 0 (every wave becomes the same sine) and back up. Velocity 1: no DCW sweep.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 0.5
track lead
preset 200 0 0 64 255 30 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 0 A2 28 1
note 0 E3 28 127
sweep p2 0 255 0 20
sweep p1 200 0 20 24
sweep p1 0 255 24 28
expect sound 0 28
expect idle 40
expect peak_below -6
